^["intent"]{
 ~#goal: "Answer, as a probe, what a second renderer needs from a frame of plain data: a canvas, a worker or a shader reads Spw without the parser, and the same reduction runs in any of them."
 ~#taste: "One reading, many uses: words and glyphs apart, one hash home, hashes nominate and equality decides; no new noun: the parse tree in columns, identities as likeness rungs, the CLI as spw form modes."
}

^["development"]{
 lane: #public_interest_research
 ladder: #service
